## 2. Struktur Firmware yang Dibuat

Firmware dibuat modular dengan standar industri C++ (PlatformIO) serta versi single-sketch (Arduino IDE):

```
firmware/
├── platformio.ini                        # Konfigurasi PlatformIO & library dependencies
├── README.md                             # Dokumentasi lengkap firmware & petunjuk flashing
├── include/
│   ├── Config.h                          # Konfigurasi terpusat (WiFi, Broker, Project Name, Timers)
│   ├── PinDefinitions.h                  # Definisi pinout sesuai skematik fisik
│   ├── WiFiManager.h                     # Header WiFi lifecycle & exponential backoff
│   ├── TimeManager.h                     # Header NTP UTC ISO 8601 synchronization
│   ├── MQTTManager.h                     # Header MQTT client, LWT, dan telemetry publisher
│   └── TelemetrySimulator.h              # Header bounded drift simulation biodigester
├── src/
│   ├── main.cpp                          # Main loop orchestrator (non-blocking)
│   ├── WiFiManager.cpp                   # Implementasi non-blocking WiFi
│   ├── TimeManager.cpp                   # Implementasi SNTP sync
│   ├── MQTTManager.cpp                   # Implementasi MQTT LWT & Online retain
│   └── TelemetrySimulator.cpp            # Implementasi drift telemetri halus
└── nicegas_esp32_arduino/
    └── nicegas_esp32_arduino.ino         # Single-sketch version untuk Arduino IDE
```

