## 3. MQTT Contract & Payload Validation

### A. Topics
1. **Telemetry**:
   ```
   nicegas/Bio-CNG Plant Alpha/DIGESTER-01/telemetry/biodigester
   ```
2. **Status (LWT & Connect)**:
   ```
   nicegas/Bio-CNG Plant Alpha/DIGESTER-01/status/connection
   ```

### B. Status Payloads (Retained = true, QoS = 1)
- **LWT (Last Will / Unclean Disconnect)**:
  ```json
  {"status": "offline"}
  ```
- **Online (Clean Connect)**:
  ```json
  {
    "status": "online",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-11T08:05:00Z",
    "device_id": "DIGESTER-01",
    "device_name": "ESP32 Biodigester Node"
  }
  ```

### C. Telemetry Payload (Published every 3s, QoS 0/1, Retain = false)
```json
{
  "timestamp": "2026-09-11T08:05:03Z",
  "status": "nominal",
  "metrics": {
    "temperature": { "v": 37.45, "u": "°C" },
    "pressure": { "v": 1.26, "u": "bar" },
    "methane": { "v": 61.2, "u": "%" },
    "gas_flow": { "v": 25.4, "u": "Nm³/h" },
    "ph": { "v": 7.12, "u": "pH" }
  }
}
```

